{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12141","headline":"离居夜雨奉寄李京兆 · 钱起","name":"离居夜雨奉寄李京兆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"永夜不可度，蛩吟秋雨滴。\n寂寞想章台，始叹云泥隔。\n雷声匪君车，犹时过我庐。\n电影非君烛，犹能明我目。\n如何琼树枝，梦里看不足。\n望望佳期阻，愁生寒草绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}